*
!.gitignore

# The blanket '*' above keeps user-uploaded images out of the repo, but it also
# silently swallows new config/assets — that is how public/css/design-system.css
# ended up 404ing in production. Anything that must actually deploy needs an
# explicit exception here.
!.user.ini

# The admin portal's stylesheet. It is application code, not an upload, and the
# blanket '*' above had left it untracked -- present on both machines by luck, and
# one edit away from silently never deploying. That is the failure this file's own
# comment warns about, so the asset it names is now excepted explicitly.
!css/
!css/design-system.css
